      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "T-S NS J120 recto, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>and to your brothers,</li>\n<li>may God endow them with life, (I send) the utmost greetings of peace,</li>\n<li>and to my lord Ab\u016b</li>\n<li>al-Fa\u1e0dl the parnas,</li>\n<li>and to his child,</li>\n<li>greetings.</li>\n<li>My (paternal) uncle sends you</li>\n<li>greetings.</li></ol>\n",
